@startuml sequence-wallets-of-user
title The user's wallets (GET /wallets/user/{userUid})

actor "Client" as Client
participant "individuals-api" as IA
box "transaction-service" #F5F9FF
    participant "WalletService" as WS
    database "DB (shard by user_uid)" as DB
end box

Client -> IA: GET the user's wallets
alt invalid token
    IA --> Client: 401
end
IA -> IA: user_uid from the token
note right of IA
  A userUid from the client is not accepted:
  the path gets the user_uid from the token
  (otherwise anyone could read others' wallets)
end note
IA -> WS: GET /wallets/user/{user_uid from the token}
WS -> DB: SELECT * FROM wallets\nWHERE user_uid = :userUid AND archived_at IS NULL
note right of DB
  ShardingSphere: user_uid → one shard,
  all the user's wallets are there
end note
alt no wallets
    WS --> IA: 200 []
    IA --> Client: 200 []
end
WS --> IA: 200 list of WalletResponse
IA --> Client: 200 list of WalletResponse
@enduml
